		{"text"},
		line=508,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020060"},
		line=508,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"A certain young couple, all alone in a dimly lit room.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The only source of illumination, the flickering television casting long shadows behind them.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The man, sitting cross-legged, casually plucks jellybeans one by one from a nearby plate before bringing them to his mouth.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The woman next to him, sprawled out in a decidedly unladylike fashion, watches him intently.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“Those don't seem quite to your tastes.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“That's exactly why I enjoy eating them.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"He wryly intones, a smirk playing across his lips.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"A broadcast of Elsa Valentine appears on the television screen.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The Republic is giving its press release regarding the explosions that occurred at the Armistice Day ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
{"font", size=45},
"“With respect to the bombings carried out at the Armistice Day ceremony, we've discovered definitive evidence which suggests that the perpetrators are linked to remaining elements of the Sworn Blades.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Many innocent Imperial civilians lost their lives as a result of these attacks.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Make no mistake: this was a vicious and criminal act. There can be no greater cause capable of justifying the indiscriminate murder of civilians.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As such, we will do everything in our power to bring the perpetrators to justice and restore order to Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
{"font", size=53},
"“If you have any useful eyewitness information to contribute, no matter how insignificant it may seem, please do not hesitate to contact the Republic government-general.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Moving on. I can report that today, the Republican Army conducted an operation connected to the remnants of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We have seized a facility believed to be an arms cache and taken into our possession a significant number of contraband spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"At this, scattered applause rings out from the journalists in the audience.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Needless to say, the possession of spellblades is strictly prohibited by law.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The presence of such a stockpile of illegal weapons is overwhelming evidence that the Sworn Blades remain a clear and present threat to national security.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Many likely believe that the Sworn Blades were eliminated following the arrests of August 8th, but this is most certainly not the case.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“They have merely gone underground, and even now persist in their treasonous activities.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“So long as they continue to exist, the Empire will never know peace.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“On behalf of the Albright Republic, I hereby declare that we will spare no effort to eradicate all those who would stand in the way of a lasting peace and prosperity!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Whew, brings a tear to my eye.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“Wouldn't you rather she were the one crying, though?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Oh, please. Do I really come across as that mean-spirited?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“There's only one person in the world I want to see cry.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The man plops another jellybean between his grinning lips.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Besides, you're hardly one to talk about making Elsa cry.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Those explosions were your handiwork, weren't they?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“Oh dear, was it that obvious?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Right at that moment, the television displays the carnage of the Armistice Day bombings.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“You know, I wanted to put on a bit of a flashier show.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“But that place is the most sacred ground in all the Empire. It had the strongest spellwards that I've ever seen.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“It made me feel the true weight of two thousand years of history.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“So, did you find anything?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“Unfortunately not.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“Though, I did sense that there might be a rather interesting discovery waiting for me underground.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“An interesting discovery?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“The Empire's greatest mystery, shall we say?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Man"},
			{
"“Now that I'd love to see for myself.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Woman"},
			{
"“I'm already working on finding another way, so you won't have to wait for long.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The woman lets out a sinister chuckle, her eyes never once leaving the man's face. ",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"All alone in that dimly lit room, despite the morbid contents of their conversation, a certain woman puts on a dazzlingly bright smile that would not be out of place on a young child.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I continue my speech in front of the cameras.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"With bold, sweeping gestures, I fervently assert over and over that the Sworn Blades are a detestable enemy of the people.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That was quite the performance you put on.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“One of my speechwriters even praised your use of gestures.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"My father mutters absently as he works his nails over with a file.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"When was the last time he offered me praise for anything?",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you very much.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Excellent work with that arms cache.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I merely investigated the location that you pointed me to.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Permission to ask a question?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"My father nods without looking at me.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How was it that you knew where that arms cache was?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“A report from one of my subordinates.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your office is investigating them as well?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I believe it would be more prudent to consolidate the investigation under one chain of command.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I wouldn't typically waste my time investigating such trivial matters.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“However, the information just happened to fall into my lap.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Are you suggesting I should have just shelved it without passing it on?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Certainly not. Excuse my rudeness.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Paying me no mind, my father blows on his nails.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"When the Armistice Day ceremony was ruined, he was rather enraged, to put it lightly.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"The marriage between Empress Hisui and the cabinet minister, which he'd invested a great deal of money in arranging, was immediately called off.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Moreover, he claims that no amount of money could make up for the face he lost among the dignitaries he personally invited from the mainland.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I heard that you're forcing Okonogi to pay reparations.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But it seems the sum you demanded far outweighs the total cost of the damages.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Then your estimate must be off.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“In the world of politics, there are a lot of expenses which crop up behind the scenes.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"My father turns his palm towards the ceiling to admire the gleam of his fingernails.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"A long time ago, I once asked him, “Why does a soldier need to polish his nails?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"His answer was “That sort of thing is necessary on certain battlefields.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"If funnelling money to people in high places on the mainland counts as war, then yes, I suppose those battlefields do exist after all.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"In this case, my father intends to earmark the vast majority of these reparations for his own purposes, leaving only a paltry sum for families of the deceased soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"And even though Okonogi is the one paying, all his wealth was plundered from Imperial citizens in the first place.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"All it amounts to is Okonogi, my father, and politicians from the mainland each taking their turn to shake down the people of the Empire for everything they've got.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"As for the victims that died in the attack? As for the innocent Imperial citizens? They're left with nothing.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Rotten to the core...)”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Even if this is the way of the world when it comes to politics, I never want to sink down to that level.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Do you still have business with me?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I also heard that you leaked information regarding Inou Kokuan to the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Oh, that.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"He intentionally leaked intelligence to a known spy who had infiltrated the army garrison.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Right around now, the warriors should be rejoicing at the news that Kokuan is still alive.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I'm the person tasked with cracking down on the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"So I should have the right to make my opinions known.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“It was my idea.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I wanted to use Kokuan as bait to lure the warriors out of hiding and crush them in one fell swoop.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That's why I leaked the intel.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why lure them to the Imperial Palace of all places?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It would be much easier to take them out if they attacked the army garrison.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“That was at Okonogi's request.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“He said he wanted to take responsibility for the bombing.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't trust him with this.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Leave it to him this time.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"This is clearly a mistake.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Did Okonogi pay him off?",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"At this rate, even if the warriors fall for the trap, they might manage to get away.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Okonogi has proven that he is not a trustworthy individual.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've sent him countless directives to implement democratizing reforms, yet he refuses to comply.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That man has no concern for anything besides his own self-interest.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I won't deny that.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“If anything, it makes it easier for us to deal with him knowing that's the sort of person he is.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“But either way, my decision is final.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Let me be clear: you are to leave this matter with Kokuan for Okonogi to deal with.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I've poured my blood, sweat, and tears into trying to take down the warriors. ",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"I won't let anyone else steal away my prize.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"If the trap has already been set for the warriors, then fine. But I want to be at the scene when it happens and take care of them personally.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"However, as part of the peace treaty, the Forbidden Guard retains exclusive jurisdiction over the Imperial Palace's security.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The palace still manages to preserve some semblance of sovereignty by barring the Republican Army from entering its premises.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Honestly, it's not looking good.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Is there any possible way I can maneuver my unit in there?",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In that case, might I audit the Imperial Palace to observe how Okonogi conducts this operation?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It would be a rare learning opportunity.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Very well. When you put it that way, I have no reason to stop you.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Do as you wish.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you for granting your permission.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
